odifier key (Shift, Ctrl, Alt, Meta) in the Input Map editor, the Physical Keycode mode clears the\r\n  'keycode' field and only keeps 'physical_keycode'. At runtime, is_action_pressed() fails for these keys because\r\n  modifier key events are handled differently from regular keys on every platform (Windows WM_INPUT for key-up, macOS\r\n  flagsChanged, X11 keyboard state tracking), making physical_keycode matching unreliable.\r\n\r\n  Fix: for modifier keys, preserve the keycode field alongside physical_keycode, so action_match() uses the keycode\r\n  comparison which works consistently across all platforms.\r\n\r\n  AI Disclosure\r\n\r\n  Used Claude Code to locate the relevant code paths and draft the fix, reviewed and tested manually.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-06-27T06:23:08Z","updated_at":"2026-06-27T12:39:09Z","closed_at":"2026-06-27T12:32:14Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"3bfa6bd85f77fe2ae427732138765353f440afaa","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"FANXING-0710:master","ref":"master","repo":{"id":1281962842,"node_id":"R_kgDOTGkzWg","name":"godot","full_name":"FANXING-0710/godot","owner":{"login":"FANXING-0710","id":126996221,"node_id":"U_kgDOB5HO_Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126996221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FANXING-0710","html_url":"https://github.com/FANXING-0710","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FANXING-0710/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FANXING-0710/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FANXING-0710/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FANXING-0710/starred{/owner}{/